This surface is a production-polished SwiftUI parity of the web `SignalCompareControls`
(pure controls: Window A/B datetime fields + 8 category prefixes + 5 quick presets +
signal filter + Clear). It binds through a P1/S8 state holder (`SignalCompareControlsModel`),
emits the P1/S11 `view.opened` diagnostics on appear, resolves every string through the
P1/S10 facade (per-surface table + web English fallback), uses P1/S9 design tokens + the
shared atoms (TSFadeIn/TSGlassPanel/TSButton/TSSkeleton), and renders every state
(loading / content / empty / error, with stale + offline freshness inside content).

